abstract: >-
  Numerical exports and executable verification for an exploratory human-computer
  interaction study of media narratives of violence in Mexico. Reproduces descriptive
  summaries, paired participant-to-centroid Wilcoxon tests, Holm adjustment, and Figure 13.
keywords:
  - human-computer interaction
  - generative AI
  - violence narratives
  - reproducibility
  - Wilcoxon
